(D) squared weights (referee's proposition)
   Example 3.1 with weights w^2: (posterior mass of F)/(posterior mass of P) = prod_i P(y_i|z_i) * (eps^2+(1-eps)^2)^(#fresh inputs), exactly;
      for eps = 1/2 and N_z = 1600 (the class built for n = 40 rounds) this is 2^-1600; at weights w it is 1.
